Repository gate remains non-closeable. The first scripts/check.sh passed fmt/check/all Clippy axes and nearly all tests, then hit a transient shared-target E0463 in fmn-anim doctest; the exact doctest immediately passed. A repeat was interrupted by foreign W2 formatting drift. Commit b164be2 then co-landed the exact W10 blobs with W2 changes and a new curve_booleans_transversal test, which now fails deterministically at committed HEAD because overlapping circles use FlattenClip instead of required CurveAwareTransversal. Exact failure is recorded on fm-qjy comment 309. The untracked cache-conventions input also remains outside committed-tree closure.

